OL,3,GNEWSABomb disposal unit deployed after
OL,4,AWW2 device found
OL,5,
OL,6,FArmy bomb disposal experts have been
OL,7,Fdeployed to a residential street
OL,8,Ffollowing the discovery of a "suspected
OL,9,FWorld War Two mortar device", police
OL,10,Fhave said.
OL,12,FSouth Yorkshire Police said officers
OL,13,Fwere called to Robin Hood Crescent, in
OL,14,FEdenthorpe, Doncaster, shortly after
OL,15,F10:15 GMT after the shell was found
OL,16,Finside a property.
OL,18,FA police spokesperson said the road had
OL,19,Fbeen closed following the discovery.
OL,23,APub: 12-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
